<title>FINLAND: Finnish 2004 bond yields 6.30 pct at auction.</title>
<headline>Finnish 2004 bond yields 6.30 pct at auction.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of the S1/93 bond was announced by the State Treasury Office:</p>
<p> ISSUER:				 Republic of Finland</p>
<p> MATURITY:			     15-03-2004</p>
<p> COUPON:				 9.50 PCT</p>
<p> AUCTION YIELD:			6.30 PCT</p>
<p> PRICE:				  118.50</p>
<p> AUCTION AMOUNT			FIM 1,782 MLN</p>
<p> BID AMOUNT:			   FIM 2,515 MLN</p>
<p> PAYMENT FREQUENCY:		  YEARLY</p>
<p>NOTES:</p>
<p>The previous auction of the bond raised 3.07 billion markka at a price of 114.80 and a yield of 6.91 percent. After today's auction, the outstanding amount is 36,595 million markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0240</p>
</text>
